r and we will be helping you  with all the details it is either myself  or adio  we will be the session is recorded uh  a fun so we will be sending you the  video of  the session  if there are any questions  thank you aditya  so i welcome you all to join either of  the training programs and collaborate  with each other yes the fellowship  program  also has a fee so  if you go to this link you will be able  to see all the details  of the fellowship program i'm again  sharing this  in the email or if you fill out the form  you will also receive an email which  will have all the details  so if you click on get started you can  see what are the different fees for  either the three months or the  six months program so this is the  standard fees and again the scholarship  option is available  so please feel free to reach out to us  with either of these  options and thank you all for joining us  today  i hope that you have a lovely week ahead  we look forward to seeing you in the  upcoming  sessions programs and seeing your  projects and thank you to all the  participants  in the bioinformatics for infectious  disease program who made time  to present today we look forward to your  projects as well  have a lovely day everybody thank you  you
 

